      "source": "Customization hook for creating description out of defined values.<br/>\nCalled by <a href=\"TypedJsonSchemaObject.html#toDocument()\"><code>TypedJsonSchemaObject.toDocument()</code></a> when no explicit <a href=\"TypedJsonSchemaObject.html#description(java.lang.String)\"><code>TypedJsonSchemaObject.description(String)</code></a> is set.",
